 update, we introduced the four major secret realms and perfected theexternal exploration loop. Today, we dive deep into the core progression systems of Fragmented Otherworld — Pavilion Scriptures, Artifact Refining, and Elixir Crafting.Master spells, forge powerful artifacts, an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-02T13:40:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165568041","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4821570-1836506165567121","game_id":"steam-4821570","kind":"announcement","title":"Otherworld Fragment Dev Log #05：Perilous Path — The Four Secret Realms & Trials","summary":"Otherworld Fragment Dev Log #05：Perilous Path — The Four Secret Realms & TrialsFloating Islands are your daily routine. Secret Realms are the climax.This update covers our dungeon design forOtherworld Fragment: four completely distinct trial realms, plus some behind-the-scenes development struggles and fixes.1. Nine-Story Demon Tower — Climb Higher, Grow StrongerA classic progressive tower dungeon. The higher the floor, the deadlier the fiends.Approach the tower and press F to enter. The dungeon","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-02T05:33:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165567121","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4821570-1836506165564722","game_id":"steam-4821570","kind":"announcement","title":"Development Log #04: Soaring Through Void — Floating Isle Exploration & ...","summary":"Development Log #04: Soaring Through Void — Floating Isle Exploration & Island-Driving Grand FormationYour party is ready. It’s time to venture out. In this log, we cover the game’s overworld system — how you locate, select, and leap to isles across the void, plus the long-polished core feature: the Myriad Worlds Star Map.Near Void: Floating Isles Around Your Home IslandThe closest exploration layer surrounds your main island, serving as your primary early-game resource zone for survival and pro","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-01T08:31:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165564722","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4821570-1836506165564167","game_id":"steam-4821570","kind":"announcement","title":"Development Log #03: Thirty Natal Sounds — Characters, Recruitment & Resonance","summary":"Development Log #03: Thirty Natal Sounds — Characters, Recruitment & ResonanceWe’ve covered combat mechanics. This time, let’s talk about characters. Besides your immortal protagonist, Otherworld Shards features a complete party system: 30 Natal Fate Disciples.Why \"Natal Sound (NaYin)\"?I wanted to avoid generic class templates such as Warrior / Mage / Assassin — they feel far too modern and industrial for a Xianxia world.I ended up adopting the traditional Sixty Jiazi Natal Sounds from ancient C","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-01T03:16:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165564167","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4821570-1836506165564095","game_id":"steam-4821570","kind":"announcement","title":"#02: The Flow of the Five Elements — Combat & Skill System","summary":"下面是可直接复制的英文版：Otherworld Fragments Dev Log #02: The Flow of the Five Elements — Combat & Skill SystemLast time we covered the core loop of \"Devour.\" This time we're zooming in on the part you actually have to fight for with your own hands: combat.Pure Real-Time. No Turns, No Truce.Let me be clear about the framing first: Otherworld Fragments is pure real-time action combat. Free movement, skill combos, dodging and repositioning — no turns, no ATB gauges.And once a fight starts, there's no negotia","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-01T02:27:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165564095","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4821570-1836506165562454","game_id":"steam-4821570","kind":"announcement","title":"Development Log #01: Survival Begins on a Dying Floating Isle","summary":"# Development Log #01: Survival Begins on a Dying Floating Isle > Hello everyone, I’m the developer of *Otherworld Shards*. > Starting with this entry, I will document 10 development logs, laying out all the design decisions and tradeoffs as this project evolves from a mere concept into a playable build. > If you enjoy Xianxia combined with real-time action and power progression through conquest, wishlist the game and watch it grow alongside me.--- ## One Single Scene That Built the Whole Game A","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-30T13:14:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165562454","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:26:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4821570":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:30:05Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:30:05Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4821570":"2026-10-26T14:30:05Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4821570":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:30:05Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:30:05Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:30:05Z"}